Security negative proof:

- Shortcut inventory rows do not claim runtime use.
- Shortcut inventory rows do not claim foreground use.
- Shortcut inventory rows do not claim content knowledge.
- Raw shortcut paths are not exposed as source ids or desktop-entry ids.
- Default live source is optional on unsupported platforms.
- No policy action or adapter execution is reachable from this source.

Validation:

- `cargo test -p ocentra-parent-agent-core live_inventory`
- `cmd /c npm run lint:schema-boundaries`
